Package: sdtmgenerator
Title: Generate and Validate CDISC SDTM Clinical Trial Datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jean", "Mendes", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jeanmlvieira@hotmail.com")
Description: Provides a modular framework for transforming synthetic
    clinical trial source data into datasets aligned with the Clinical
    Data Interchange Standards Consortium (CDISC) Study Data Tabulation
    Model (SDTM). Supports domain-specific transformations, variable
    mapping, data validation, and reproducible clinical data workflows.
